---
// The effects layer's canvas: C4 the teleport flash, D2 the impact, G2 the
// warp. It sits above every scene and under the chrome, takes no pointer
// events and is nothing to a screen reader. It is put away (display: none)
// until an effect opens it, so at rest there is no layer to composite.
// src/experience/fx/ draws on it.
---

<canvas id="fx-canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>

<style is:global>
	#fx-canvas {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 30;
		display: none;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	#fx-canvas[data-on] {
		display: block;
	}
</style>
